    <sys:String x:Key="Limits_Title" xml:space="preserve">Known limitations</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Limits_Text" xml:space="preserve">- Input cannot be sent to the secure desktop (UAC prompts, lock screen).&#10;- The overlay cannot appear over exclusive full-screen games (borderless is fine).&#10;- Games with anti-cheat may block software input.&#10;- In Game profiles the original button press also reaches the game (double input). Use buttons the game does not use.&#10;- Whether a game recognizes the pad in DInput mode depends on the game.&#10;- No virtual controller output (gyro-to-stick is not possible).&#10;- Mouse movement is affected by Windows 'Enhance pointer precision'.</sys:String>
